# Playwright MCP / runtime artifacts
.playwright-mcp/
# Loose captures written to the repo root (Playwright MCP resolves relative
# screenshot filenames against the root). Anchored to the root so image assets
# under public/, src/ or docs/ are never ignored.
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.webp
# Playwright Test output (for the later test phase)
/test-results/
/playwright-report/
/blob-report/
/playwright/.cache/

# Machine-local Claude Code settings (Impeccable writes its hook config here)
.claude/settings.local.json

# Dependencies and build output
node_modules/
dist/
.astro/
.lighthouseci/
*.tsbuildinfo
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Vendored third-party skill kept local (3.6 MB incl. executable Python and tests).
# Pinned commit and re-install steps are recorded in .claude/TOOLING.md.
.claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/

# Local Claude Code tooling (kept on disk, not shipped with the site)
.claude/skills/
